00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.307
We remember server-side
what your settings are.

00:19:25.307 --> 00:19:26.890
Same thing with
environment variables.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.598
There's a couple of
environment variables

00:19:28.598 --> 00:19:31.068
that this particular
